== a-init
kit, wrong passphrase                denied: wrong passphrase
cli kit                              exit 0
the kit                              mode 600, the secret key true, a QR code true
cli kit, the same path again         exit 1, unchanged true
machines, named                      machine A (this)
a code                               ok
status                               unlocked enrolled
owner exit status 0
== b-enroll
status                               locked not-enrolled
kit, not enrolled                    locked: this machine is not enrolled: unlock it with the secret key
unlock, the secret key given         ok
machines, named                      machine A; machine B (this)
status                               unlocked enrolled
owner exit status 0
== a-rekey
domain status, before any vault verb newMachines [machine B]
status                               unlocked enrolled new: machine B
domain status                        newMachines [machine B]
machines                             machine A (this); machine B
status, after the list               unlocked enrolled
domain status, after the list        newMachines []
rekey, wrong passphrase              denied: wrong passphrase
rekey                                secret key 5-5-5-5-6, a new one: true, pending: none
codes, under the new key             [ACME / john] corrupt 0
machines                             machine A (this)
status                               unlocked enrolled retired: 1
owner exit status 0
== b-after
unlock, the old secret key           denied: wrong secret key: it is not this vault's
status                               locked not-enrolled secret-key-replaced retired: 1
unlock, the new secret key           ok
status                               unlocked enrolled retired: 1
codes, under the new key             [ACME / john] corrupt 0
machines, named again                machine A; machine B (this)
lock --forget                        ok
owner exit status 0
== a-last
status                               unlocked enrolled retired: 1
machines                             machine A (this)
passphrase --generate                6 words of letters: true
lock                                 ok
unlock, the generated passphrase     ok
rekey again                          ok
status, re-keyed twice               unlocked enrolled retired: 2
codes, under the third key           [ACME / john] corrupt 0
owner exit status 0
